# Roneira AI HIFI — ML service environment
# Copy to ml/.env and adjust if needed. Loaded via load_dotenv() in app/main.py.

# Directory where trained model artifacts (LSTM/GAN/RandomForest weights) live.
# Optional — defaults to ml/artifacts/generated if unset. Relative paths are
# resolved against the ml/ directory.
# ML_MODEL_DIR=artifacts/generated

# REQUIRED. Shared secret that callers must present as the X-ML-Service-Token
# header on every data endpoint (/predict, /market-data, /stock/{ticker},
# /history, /screener). Must be IDENTICAL to ML_SERVICE_TOKEN in the Next.js
# app's environment.
#
# This service is publicly routable so Vercel can reach it, and CORS is a
# browser policy that does nothing against curl -- so without this token every
# endpoint is open to anyone who finds the hostname. If it is unset, those
# endpoints return 503 rather than running unauthenticated.
#
# / and /health stay open so platform health checks keep working.
# Generate one with:  openssl rand -hex 32
ML_SERVICE_TOKEN=
